WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:08.920
Good morning, Jay and the Stan team.
I'd like to enter my application for Launchpad.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:19.720
My name is Sathian Srikrishnan. I am 43 years old
and a startup founder of Tooth Fairy Network,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:31.800
where we turn a child's lost tooth into their first digital wallet.
I built this product for my own children.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:40.160
I'm a divorced dad of two children,
and I stumbled upon this idea through the natural course of life.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:53.760
I was a bit reluctant to even think and try this,
but I've been coming to a few of the Stan events
and been pretty impressed with the team, the people,
and the way you approach things.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.560
And so I think this will be a wonderful learning opportunity.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:10.600
I will be entering as a solo founder,
and I'm using AI as my co-founder.
I have a prototype and product

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:23.520
that's been clunky, that I'm revising daily,
and the current iteration I think genuinely has a chance of doing well.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:33.720
I'm pretty good with people, and I'm pretty open-minded, guys,
so I think I will learn a lot from the other young founders

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:42.440
and people at this retreat, workshop.
So I think I want to give it a shot.

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:56.100
It is definitely out of my comfort zone.
I'm pretty sure I'll be the oldest person there,
but I think that's what learning and growth requires.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:01.760
So I hope this intro video suffices
with a little bit of information.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.920
You can visit my product at toothfairy.network.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:16.920
There's a couple of big changes coming to the platform as well.
Like all products, it's constantly evolving.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:26.280
And I appreciate your time and consideration
and look forward to your response. Thank you.
